  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/logo/logo.png\" alt=\"Friends&amp;Foes - 繁花花牛\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Buy Me a Coffee&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"請我喝杯咖啡\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Become a Patron&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon\" alt=\"成為贊助者\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label=Join Our Discord&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Wiki&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"維基\"> </a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Friends&amp;Foes - 繁花花牛 是一個為 Friends&amp;Foes 模組設計的擴充模組，為每種花朵新增對應的花牛變體。花牛出沒於草甸與繁花森林生物群系中。您可以查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a> 以獲取更多關於花牛的資訊。</span></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">🐮 花牛變體</span></p>\n<hr>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">大花葱</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">天藍翠雀花</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_allium.png\" alt=\"大花葱花牛\" width=\"133\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_azure_bluet.png\" alt=\"天藍翠雀花花牛\" width=\"146\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">藍蘭花</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">矢車菊</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_blue_orchid.png\" alt=\"藍蘭花花牛\" width=\"149\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_cornflower.png\" alt=\"矢車菊花牛\" width=\"139\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">蒲公英</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">丁香</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_dandelion.png\" alt=\"蒲公英花牛\" width=\"149\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_lilac.png\" alt=\"丁香花牛\" width=\"144\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">鈴蘭</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">橙色鬱金香</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_lily_of_the_valley.png\" alt=\"鈴蘭花牛\" width=\"140\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_orange_tulip.png\" alt=\"橙色鬱金香花牛\" width=\"137\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">雛菊</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">牡丹</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_oxeye_daisy.png\" alt=\"雛菊花牛\" width=\"134\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_peony.png\" alt=\"牡丹花牛\" width=\"150\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">粉紅鬱金香</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">虞美人</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_pink_tulip.png\" alt=\"粉紅鬱金香花牛\" width=\"137\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_poppy.png\" alt=\"虞美人花牛\" width=\"142\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">紅色鬱金香</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">玫瑰叢</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_red_tulip.png\" alt=\"紅色鬱金香花牛\" width=\"137\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_rose_bush.png\" alt=\"玫瑰叢花牛\" width=\"142\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">向日葵</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">白色鬱金香</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_sunflower.png\" alt=\"向日葵花牛\" width=\"150\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_white_tulip.png\" alt=\"白色鬱金香花牛\" width=\"137\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">⚙️ 其他擴充模組／數據包</span></p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends&amp;Foes - 養蜂人小屋</a></li>\n<li><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">結構再利用 - Friends and Foes 相容數據包</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">💬 社群</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎 <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的 Discord 伺服器</a> 進行交流、分享您的創作、提出任何問題，或單純追蹤模組的最新開發進度與新版本發布通知。同時，若發現任何崩潰或錯誤，也請不要猶豫透過 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Issues 進行回報</a>。</span></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">👋 贊助支援</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">無論是否有贊助，我都會繼續開發我的模組，因為這是我的興趣所在，儘管我的大部分空閒時間都投入在模組開發上。因此，如果您仍想支持我，可以透過 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 或 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a> 進行贊助。在此先行感謝您的所有支持。</span></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">📜 授權條款</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組採用 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms%252fmaster%252fLICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a> 授權條款。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎參考我的原始碼，了解我在開發此模組時如何實作並解決各種問題，亦可將相關程式碼片段融入您的專案中。此外，您也可自由將此模組用於任何整合包中（若能註明出處或連結回此頁面將不勝感激）。</span></p>",
